{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/36db74c7835672e3cbeaa10a38f32bb21e1dfc4ab5efda6a7fd4574705f05373a71addb939796b578af00f08c333c78ec7156c31426786013d5118f15a93f6a77c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/43e926d238caed5c82cfe7f44ca020a1af3eccab5daa032e176c81e5fa679cbbe2766de411b330f46869a776b6005e0c533152ff8f035c1234226f4ff00e23c98beda8320fccaf858db878b92ba8db\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c40cf4b39dff854a4582627a0f15823a2a0477b48a8893cd04f335da14241336e560576ba6e44dac9d13d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6b5d04292aefaf061ab95f70ac3f8e51e8dd6ef6c8a7cd74425924dbe717e81e60a143d4918c93a674d349a7ef900b3dac56d491ec43aad8df873efb02cdfeb38ba1e9799f2831b4664e5bf70849e8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/450585a638e53f0feaf79926c9577935cccef9b9c662b97f7b0faf4812838818e176a6a9b5abed6b97da25e466832f4b2193a19d1a7de05e317b24c6a14f6fe682f075fcd24ecdc846e56153f02759\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/520cd5faebd6fa6e740a08bb7a99a30435af9cba30a2e2ed104b8b717b58e8d1f89e879b0064cba6bb4a14e555e88b18bd134f8c6b3d3efa368f50e1bf07e8517509f015d4367acd0ba60a7521f360\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ea4e91cb2c2438d5acc7dee6ca4fd5606b3f4afbea1b5ff24fac5a6123e45763b56323e7784e67c1221bddd230800eee03f701d4aec278452195d9c88ef4fc566e056b07aa03c17bed9d8f40b9072c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/97330925fdc761bfb9f4a768405f370fbdd749b66bf2f7b17545bf7e89a973ad9ff478b3745a322551ed2ea467e5352ef9b0cd3d8a1f9e5a0112bf84a72ed23d75a16bb8e3765226a9cdfdadca3788\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1300ec0ed2b12a617854d10165d9b7689931b76e04344837b7424b38126d9873237b243e8709b38a34f486c9c7e6770d7db540207d36e254abbf04de95bf2581393b4bd19420e7a37528a3135333ac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0aa806220b1212e337f19b3bb17821f471ddf0a8aec75ad231d39cb2ef646c01dfbbeac133be0dfcd8fb62d432eb8189c205ad4f70e4ce49c4fd9a55c046c848a27440313574af1be94a751c232c90\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/505cfa00b5fb014f3fe75598053652fffe7320f8d7e3fd61cad5d494f5e362c15c7e67e3b89c18921295abd80df657d7107761593da31d7e0fd6168c0d2994fa5c8c98c5a121b3411b563b0860d26b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/44217638aa1f11b6114f1c668582a9fc7f2ff9c30cfff28b2f772a3b2edcee41bed1d35b962c69c310188a00f46e156b66d057c6c744371482171c9b8644b9f5436b9a4172229e1cff40cf45f3571a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/65b6b79120226fdef8ef73652b821ef749da863e1045cb032044b42b7e6ea4d6c57223947802a53b0c9d9b81973785e569949e9118db61094f8bbe805d102ef436ef3b86816800ceaf398b0b1789e1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5ef9043d894d6f069b95ee3b717d531417e3f13dac529ab5993d5dc7a445867e8b3227ea3e06d413197a5e712f3b5066ff6adcd7ad99dd7fa62800a7b00028c99d30d0b65ba59333dc974f31c2777e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/495a0fbb4f4a0a47eb1135836804a9d30b18a165c813faebfcf6ef079c02d4e6b5b363d47cee6b1f7c66cfc14df585b6d2efc36f774b34f40c43983b277e6bb39ed884c6e25ae397eef1cc2fe1dce9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a88304d26fd32f116fcd94a14098bfabe2a390e20f31b80098942ec332952a44aea7ad36c59881b58fa6b3149cae505a81a20ca651a581d202bfb3740751c66d57b8d760a6555b008b13e97aa2a9c4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c66b91f00975320e691e4f40ba3a07194e6df71c5c29e4bf3692171f74478b49bd8efde555facaad4d437cc95ce084c5e4f66bee5684128aa5bcc18a18da4212a5ea337bbd84c50048ce5496ef2d5f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/69e362ba2347269c5deb907fc4aba57d3fbe74b6b6b27518f722c088d6d5d3f94365fb7d0eb4a8aec456aa87e7c994a612852031b72edf14c198b4f78b426e5f7a7428f1ec7ade95de725fd4692c9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2cc47930e84316b908e4bcd779c14a81ff6d7d83bfb068e5c19941acf3328dbc6ceb821e12d6fa20afb982621ceeb4536d4fbfef759644b063dc83bbdeafffd6c62f1479a1762947251c743cc559e9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0567370e6096fe8c6a3cf5a23c5813cfbd48f396da4918324cf5fb89281fbd24068fa627b0a6dc2a1f6183d9f8b088ea6330fb5a2a243cb774ba50edd4b665082075adaface0a64cd8241eef2bf223\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
